
"smart_sources:Gemini对话/品牌设计/LOGO设计/2026-04/W3/2026-04-21_A dramatic, cinematic photo of_155.md": {"path":"Gemini对话/品牌设计/LOGO设计/2026-04/W3/2026-04-21_A dramatic, cinematic photo of_155.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1ht4c94","at":1778495712272},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1778425872753,"size":5755,"at":1778495712272,"hash":"1ht4c94"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"##A dramatic, cinematic photo of the East Asian man from image_1.png in his white athletic jacket and wire-rim glasses. He is leaning over a cluttered workbench late at night, illuminated by the cool blue light of two large computer monitors displaying real data terminal screens and graphs (no scrolling matrix code rain, just raw text). His face is focused, slightly tired, a reflection of the screens in his glasses. He holds a soldering iron, meticulously examining a disassembled iPhone 13 Pro mainboard. Near him are handwritten notes like \"Device ID mismatch\", \"Exif residue found\", and an empty coffee cup. The color palette is composed of moody dark blues, steel grey, and warm amber accents from a small desk lamp. A subtle, realistic film grain covers the image, giving it a raw, non-AI photographic texture. Shallow depth of field, focused on his face and the phone components. Low-key lighting. --ar 16:9 --iw 2":[11,12],"##A dramatic, cinematic photo of the East Asian man from image_1.png in his white athletic jacket and wire-rim glasses. He is leaning over a cluttered workbench late at night, illuminated by the cool blue light of two large computer monitors displaying real data terminal screens and graphs (no scrolling matrix code rain, just raw text). His face is focused, slightly tired, a reflection of the screens in his glasses. He holds a soldering iron, meticulously examining a disassembled iPhone 13 Pro mainboard. Near him are handwritten notes like \"Device ID mismatch\", \"Exif residue found\", and an empty coffee cup. The colo